## What

The agent report (`sg-212.1`). Each failure in the report names:
- the scenario;
- the failing step;
- the expected and actual values;
- the driver trace.

The report is written for an agent's next change. A void verdict names its cause and carries no pass or fail counts (design §7).

## Acceptance Criteria

- The `sg-212.1` scenario passes under the pinned judge.
- A property test shows that every failed scenario in the harness results appears in the report with all five fields.
